{"publicId":"c85ff4ea-ffaf-43eb-9c6d-200b13d7a40d","title":"OpenAI Q3营收增长50%至百亿但亏损扩大，Anthropic首次反超","status":"watching","reportCount":3,"sourceCount":2,"firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T21:25:47.000Z","latestAt":"2026-11-10T23:11:16.000Z","digest":"OpenAI 2026年第三季度营收达100亿美元（同比增50%），企业客户贡献超50%，主要来自API使用及GPT-5.6等新产品，微软因此关联增收10亿美元。但同季度OpenAI调整后运营亏损扩大至109亿美元（早前为-150%），市场隐含破产概率从8.5%升至16.5%。Anthropic同期营收近170亿美元，首次超越OpenAI，其前九个月营收同比增1206%至332亿美元（需验证OpenAI全年700亿美元预测）。","digestUpdatedAt":"2026-11-11T10:07:00.741Z","summary":null,"excerpt":null,"latest":"OpenAI Q3调整后运营利润率从-150%升至-109%","latestReport":{"id":"zlfiv3vjsllgfhwcj52vytqvz"},"whyHot":{"participants48h":0,"newParticipants6h":0,"recentReports24h":0,"observationComplete":true,"rank":null},"developments":[{"factId":"flOxwK-VFBYY","title":"OpenAI’s adjusted operating margin improves from -150% to -1","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T23:11:16.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"zlfiv3vjsllgfhwcj52vytqvz","title":"OpenAI Q3调整后运营利润率从-150%升至-109%","summary":"OpenAI Q3调整后运营利润率从-150%升至-109%，收入达约$10 billion，同比增长50%，企业客户收入占比过半，主要来自API使用及GPT-5.6等新产品。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T23:11:16.000Z","selected":true}},{"factId":"fv9VoY3gW0Bs","title":"OpenAI narrows operating margin loss from -150% to -109% in ","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T23:10:10.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"svjatllfkloui821n9r92xydl","title":"OpenAI Q3调整后运营亏损收窄至-109%","summary":"OpenAI 宣布 Q3 调整后运营亏损收窄至-109%，同时披露正寻求高达 200 亿美元的新融资，已有 110 亿美元承诺。市场认为该改善降低了破产风险，但融资进展和竞争对手 Anthropic 的盈利表现仍为关键观察点。","source":{"name":"Crypto Briefing","firstParty":false},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T23:10:10.000Z","selected":true}},{"factId":"fo_B1uCmeICQ","title":"OpenAI第三季度营收约100亿美元，增长约50%","firstReportAt":"2026-11-10T21:25:47.000Z","reportCount":1,"representative":{"id":"td5t408mnpe1vkzxos1xl6veq","title":"OpenAI第三季度营收约100亿美元，同比增长50%","summary":"OpenAI第三季度营收约100亿美元，同比增长50%，结束此前增长放缓期。增长主要源于客户对AI新模型及企业级产品需求的回升。","source":{"nam